---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Public API — QuantClarity"
  description="The anonymous, read-only QuantClarity API and its publication status."
  currentPath="/api"
>
  <article class="prose shell">
    <header class="page-header flush">
      <p class="eyebrow">Anonymous · Read-only · Versioned</p>
      <h1>Public API</h1>
      <p class="lede narrow">
        The API serves the same canonical publication as this website. No public
        dataset has been released yet, so data resources are not available.
      </p>
    </header>
    <h2>Contract</h2>
    <p>
      Resources use JSON and UTF-8 under the stable <code>/v1</code> base path. Unknown
      facts use documented null or explicit unknown values. Decimal prices are serialized
      without binary floating-point artifacts.
    </p>
    <p>
      The generated <a
        href="https://github.com/jsmarble/quant-clarity/blob/main/contracts/generated/openapi.json"
        rel="noreferrer">OpenAPI contract and examples</a
      > are available in the public source repository. Serving the contract at <code
        >/v1/openapi.json</code
      > remains gated with the first public data publication. Public methods are limited
      to GET, HEAD, and protocol-required OPTIONS.
    </p>
    <h2>Privacy and caching</h2>
    <p>
      Requests require no account or credential. Query-string and search
      responses are private and non-cacheable. QuantClarity retains no request
      logs, traces, query strings, or visitor identifiers.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
